  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "Air Bombs is a defensive building, unlocked at Builder Hall 4, that exclusively targets aerial enemies. It continuously launches explosive barrels, resembling the Air Bomb, a trap from the Home Village, at air troops that deal heavy damage in a small area."
  ],
